local-09: structured decisions endpoint (POST /v1/systemone) backported from vLLM 0.32.0

Upstream: #59299 (endpoint, choice), #60677 (served without opt-in flag),
#60696 (noul + score question types), all in v0.32.0. Files copied verbatim from
the v0.32.0 tag, with these local changes for the 0.31 tree:
- imports: vllm.renderers.chat_utils -> vllm.entrypoints.chat_utils
- serving.py: _get_trace_headers() shim (BaseServing gains it only in 0.32)
- strategies.py: Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration -> NextTokenStrategy
  (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next is not in upstream READ_STRATEGIES, even on main)
- launchers/api_server: register the router and init its state
Engine, kernels and every other patch are untouched. Drop when the image moves
to a vLLM release that ships this endpoint and maps Qwen4Exp.

